            <ArticleTitle>Choose to Move for Positive Living: physical activity program for obese women.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>120-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1097/HNP.0b013e31824ef4ca</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The Choose to Move for + (Positive) Living program was implemented to increase physical activity among obese women. A holistic approach was used to promote stage of health behavior change, social support, and quality of life and reduce depression. Within 6 months, physical fitness improved and depressive symptoms decreased.</AbstractText>
